{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\B2shareBridge\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "autoloader-authoritative",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "composer.json: config.classmap-authoritative"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The Composer autoloader is optimized beyond level 1. The manual allows only config.optimize-autoloader: an authoritative class map breaks the upgrade of the app, and APCu is no required extension.",
        "  composer.json: config.classmap-authoritative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "private-api",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/Version010100Date20200324092922.php:65 OC",
        "lib/Migration/Version010100Date20200324092922.php:65 OC::$server"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 uses of the private API of the server in 1 file. Only OCP and NCU are public: what is below OC changes without notice between majors.",
        "  lib/Migration/Version010100Date20200324092922.php:65 OC",
        "  lib/Migration/Version010100Date20200324092922.php:65 OC::$server"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "job-time-sensitivity",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Cron/B2shareCommunityFetcher.php OCA\\B2shareBridge\\Cron\\B2shareCommunityFetcher"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 timed job does not say whether it is time sensitive. A job that sets TIME_INSENSITIVE with setTimeSensitivity() is moved to the maintenance window of the server; whether a job is heavy enough for that only its maintainer knows.",
        "  lib/Cron/B2shareCommunityFetcher.php OCA\\B2shareBridge\\Cron\\B2shareCommunityFetcher"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/PublishController.php:381 time()",
        "lib/Controller/ViewController.php:654 new DateTime()",
        "lib/Cron/TransferHandler.php:154 new DateTime()",
        "lib/Cron/TransferHandler.php:228 time()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 4 places. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Controller/PublishController.php:381 time()",
        "  lib/Controller/ViewController.php:654 new DateTime()",
        "  lib/Cron/TransferHandler.php:154 new DateTime()",
        "  lib/Cron/TransferHandler.php:228 time()"
      ],
      "folds": [
        {
          "at": 4,
          "count": 1
        }
      ]
    }
